  "details": "The new Third-Person View feature has keybinds listed in its own announcement/description (F5 to toggle, TAB to freely rotate, scroll wheel to adjust distance), but these are not reflected in the Keybinds section of the settings or documentation.\n\nUsers who go looking for keybind info in the dedicated Keybinds section won't find them there, which is where they'd naturally look first. Would be good to have these added for consistency and discoverability, especially since the feature is new and people will be exploring it for the first time.",
